{"id":938804,"title":"结课测试｜来检验一下你的学习结果吧！","content":"<p>你好，我是袁从德。</p>\n<p>《大模型应用一站式开发》正式结课了，为认真学习的你点赞！为了帮你检验自己的学习成果，我特意准备了一套结课测试题。题目共有 20 道，10道单选题，10道多选题，满分 100 分，快来挑战一下吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=9350&exam_id=20995\"><img src=\"./images/938804_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>最后，我还给你准备了一个<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/rwig35\">结课问卷</a>，希望你可以抽几分钟填一下，主要是想听听你对这门课的看法和建议。期待你的反馈！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/rwig35\"><img src=\"./images/938804_2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404735,"user_name":"enjoylearning","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000237,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DCAF8538DEA277","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1768401916,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147307,"content":"非常感谢一路的陪伴\n后续有新内容会第一时间同步，记得常回来看看","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1615593,"ctime":1768442259,"ip_address":"中国香港","comment_id":404735,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101089201,"comment_content":"期待加餐😂","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1615593,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/a6/e9/1aceb986.jpg","nickname":"袁从德","note":"","ucode":"3166F1109448CD","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":676904,"discussion_content":"非常感谢一路的陪伴\n后续有新内容会第一时间同步，记得常回来看看","content_length":91,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1768442259,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"中国香港","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1000237,"avatar":"","nickname":"enjoylearning","note":"","ucode":"DCAF8538DEA277","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":fals